        {
            "effetObjet": "",
            "effetPv": 5,
            "effetXp": -5,
            "html": "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\nhr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }\nli.unchecked::marker { content: \"\\2610\"; }\nli.checked::marker { content: \"\\2612\"; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Une caverne beante s'ouvre devant vous, l'air sent le soufre. Votre torche crepite dans l'obscurite.</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Que decidez-vous ?</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><a href=\"page2.html#pv=-5\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#094fd1;\">Entrer dans la caverne sombre </span></a></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><a href=\"page3.html#xp=5\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#094fd1;\">Contourner prudemment par la riviere </span></a></p></body></html>",
            "titre": "Le seuil de la caverne"
        },
        {
            "effetObjet": "",
            "effetPv": -5,
            "effetXp": 10,
            "html": "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\nhr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }\nli.unchecked::marker { content: \"\\2610\"; }\nli.checked::marker { content: \"\\2612\"; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Des gobelins endormis ronflent autour d'un coffre. Une epee rouillee accroche la lueur de votre torche.</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><a href=\"page4.html#objet=Epee\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#094fd1;\">Ramasser l'epee rouillee </span></a></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><a href=\"page5.html#pv=-10\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#094fd1;\">Filer en courant vers le tunnel </span></a></p></body></html>",
            "titre": "La salle aux gobelins"
        },
        {
            "effetObjet": "épée",
            "effetPv": -8,
            "effetXp": 5,
            "html": "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\nhr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }\nli.unchecked::marker { content: \"\\2610\"; }\nli.checked::marker { content: \"\\2612\"; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Une eau noire murmure entre les rochers glissants.</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><a href=\"page5.html#pv=-8\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#094fd1;\">Traverser a la nage </span></a></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><a href=\"page4.html#xp=5\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#094fd1;\">Suivre la berge en observant les traces </span></a></p></body></html>",
            "titre": "La riviere souterraine"
        },
        {
            "effetObjet": "épées",
            "effetPv": 10,
            "effetXp": -10,
            "html": "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\nhr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }\nli.unchecked::marker { content: \"\\2610\"; }\nli.checked::marker { content: \"\\2612\"; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Un vieux pont enjambe un gouffre sans fond. Au-dessus, une herse est retenue par une corde tendue.</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><a href=\"page6.html#requiert=Epee;xp=10\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#094fd1;\">Trancher la corde d'un coup d'epee </span></a></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><a href=\"page6.html#pv=-5\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#094fd1;\">Traverser prudemment sous la herse </span></a></p></body></html>",
            "titre": "Le pont de pierre"
        },
        {
            "effetObjet": "Fusil",
            "effetPv": 10,
            "effetXp": 15,
            "html": "<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd\">\n<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><meta charset=\"utf-8\" /><style type=\"text/css\">\np, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }\nhr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }\nli.unchecked::marker { content: \"\\2610\"; }\nli.checked::marker { content: \"\\2612\"; }\n</style></head><body style=\" font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:13pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;\">\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Des sarcophages poussiereux s'alignent le long des murs. Quelque chose brille dans l'un d'eux.</p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><a href=\"page6.html#objet=Amulette;xp=5\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#094fd1;\">Fouiller les sarcophages </span></a></p>\n<p style=\" margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><a href=\"page6.html#pv=-5\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; color:#094fd1;\">Avancer sans t'attarder </span></a></p></body></html>",
            "titre": "La crypte oubliee"
        },
        {
            "effetObjet": "",
